  (descr "EconoDUAL 3 half-bridge module outline, HIITIO HCS600FH120D3C1 (DS RevX.0.1 p.2 Fig.2) = HCG600FH120D3E1EA (DS p.8). Drawn as the datasheet TOP view = view from the PCB top with the module UNDER the board: place on the FRONT side, never flip. Aux pins 1.15x0.6 (HCS) / 1.15x0.8 (HCG) rectangular solder pins, sheet gives no PCB hole: 1.6/2.8 default used, see MANIFEST. Power terminals 3,4,10,11 = M6 screw terminals at bolt centres, 6.4 mm clearance; laminated busbar bolts there, PCB cut-out is a layout decision.")
